  "caveats": [
    "Two held-out repeats are not two independent training runs or 100 distinct initial positions.",
    "One training chain per task per arm; no independent training-run variance is estimated.",
    "75 valid tasks are a filtered subset of the 100 registered DexVerse tasks: 94 build with released assets, 17 lack object pose in state observations, and 2 fail reset checks.",
    "Policies use simulator state observations, including object state; these are not vision-only or real-robot results.",
    "L3PG is excluded from this 75-task table because it was run on the 69 E2 tasks only.",
    "The numerical denominator includes zero-valued scores for unaccepted tasks; it is not a count of simulator episodes actually executed.",
    "The two arms differ in tool access: A0 has built-in CEM search, while L3+papers has model-directed search, numerical compute and papers."
  ],
  "search_cost_definition": "Recorded search_rollouts counter, averaged over all valid tasks in each category, including unaccepted tasks. Excludes learning episodes, frozen training evaluations, held-out tests, and any uncounted interrupted work.",
  "search_cost_claim": "Mean search rollouts per task are below 150 in four of the six categories in each arm. This is a category mean, not an upper bound for every task or total simulator interaction."
}
